Z||000000||WKDFIRO||07-31-2000||02:33 PM||||I got this from Suzan Prince of the Silver State Fieros and thought I would pass it on to anyone of you that are in the area. Sounds like fun! Any more info just e-mail Suzan. If I get any more info I will pass it on to the Forum.<P>October 6,7,8,9  Las Vegas Nevada<BR>Silver State Fieros<BR>The information is coming,  Hope you can attend.<P>Rooms at Circus Circus start at 46.00  Rooms at Palace Station start at 69.00.<P>Fun weekend-  tour Red Rock Canyon on Saturday and see old Las Vegas tour Hoover Dam on Sunday or go to an Auto Cross.<P>Dancing on Friday and Saturday and Sunday<P>Private Restaraunt for Banquet.<P>If you know anyone I don't please let them know about the weekend and the fun and great weather they will enjoy,<P>Thank you<BR>Suzan Prince  Co-Director Silver State Fieros<BR>suzanprince@hotmail.com<BR>||||reg||6
